{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51817","headline":"八公山（嘉庆志按《江南通志》引《纲目集览》云：「山在寿春者，淮南王与八公憇处；在巢县者，王遇八公处。」《方舆胜览》以爲晋败苻坚处，非是。） · 吴资","name":"八公山（嘉庆志按《江南通志》引《纲目集览》云：「山在寿春者，淮南王与八公憇处；在巢县者，王遇八公处。」《方舆胜览》以爲晋败苻坚处，非是。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幼度提晋师，胡卒惊鹤唳。\n城外军屯垒，可数不可计。\n至今风雨夜，鬼哭杂异类。\n（《光绪续修庐州府志》六《山川志》上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴资","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}